    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract contract for clinic-service entity handlers (patients, visits, reports, prescriptions, ...). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the subset of CRUDS operations meaningful for clinic entities plus patient visit retrieval. Implementations (<ref refid="classClinicController" kindref="compound">ClinicController</ref>) specialize behaviour per entity type: for example only Patient/Visits support Delete, only <ref refid="classPatient" kindref="compound">Patient</ref> supports Search and GetVisits. <computeroutput><ref refid="callback_8hpp_1a46d97763fde9c175df21fc9b8f73b1d3" kindref="member">CALLBACK_</ref></computeroutput> is <computeroutput>std::function&lt;void(int, const std::string&amp;)&gt;</computeroutput>; implementations answer exactly once with an HTTP status code and body on every completing path, including &quot;not implemented&quot; rejections. <simplesect kind="note"><para>Only Create, Read, Delete and GetVisits have coroutine forms in this contract; Update and Search are synchronous only. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classClinicController" kindref="compound">ClinicController</ref>, <ref refid="classEntityControllerBase" kindref="compound">EntityControllerBase</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
